<title>USA: NBA BASKETBALL-LIST OF UNANIMOUS ALL-NBA FIRST TEAM CHOICES.</title>
<headline>NBA BASKETBALL-LIST OF UNANIMOUS ALL-NBA FIRST TEAM CHOICES.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>List of players to have won</p>
<p>unanimous selection to All-NBA Teams (since 1981-82):</p>
<p> 1996-97  Michael Jordan, Chicago     115 of 115 votes</p>
<p>	    Karl Malone, Utah	     115 of 115</p>
<p> 1995-96  Michael Jordan, Chicago     113 of 113</p>
<p> 1992-93  Charles Barkley, Phoenix     98 of 98</p>
<p>	    Michael Jordan, Chicago	98 of 98</p>
<p> 1988-89  Karl Malone, Utah		85 of 85</p>
<p> 1987-88  Michael Jordan, Chicago	80 of 80</p>
<p> 1986-87  Magic Johnson, LA Lakers     78 of 78</p>
<p> 1985-86  Larry Bird, Boston	     78 of 78</p>
<p> 1984-85  Larry Bird, Boston	     78 of 78</p>
<p> 1981-82  Larry Bird, Boston	     69 of 69</p>
</text>
